# CI 脚本必须是 LF：Windows 上检出成 CRLF 后，Linux runner 里的 bash 会把行尾的 \r
# 当成命令的一部分（set: -o: invalid option 之类），脚本直接跑不起来。
# CI scripts must stay LF: checked out as CRLF on Windows, bash on the Linux runner would
# treat the trailing \r as part of each command and the script would fail outright.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf

* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
